<title>FRANCE: Peugeot block sold at 614 francs per share.</title>
<headline>Peugeot block sold at 614 francs per share.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of shares representing 2.6 percent in Peugeot was placed by Michelin at a price of 614 francs per share, said a syndicate manager at bank Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p>&quot;There was a lot of demand. Unfortunately were were limited by SEC rule 144 to sell a maximum one percent to U.S. investors,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;The rest was placed mainly in Europe, particularly in France,&quot; he said, adding the book had closed within a few hours.</p>
<p>The price at 614 francs was a 3.76 percent discount to the Wednesday close.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
